  {"say": "Schematic of the classic five-engine Gravity suit (as described 2020–2022): two micro gas turbines on each forearm, one on the back. The Mk4 (not shown) has three back turbines; its total engine count is not published.", "unchecked": "Version years from the fact key (F1, F2)", "camera": "back", "orbit": -65, "highlight": ["armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2", "back"], "annotate": ["lVersion", "lArms", "lBack", "lPilot"], "focus": ["pilot.skull", "helmet", "pilot.footL", "pilot.footR", "armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2", "back"]},
  {"say": "Each engine pushes along its own axis: one arrow per engine. To hover, the upward parts of these thrusts balance the weight of pilot, suit and fuel. The sideways forces and turning moments balance too.", "camera": "back", "highlight": ["armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2", "back"], "annotate": ["aTB", "aTL1", "aTL2", "aTR1", "aTR2"], "focus": ["pilot.skull", "helmet", "pilot.footL", "pilot.footR", "armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2", "back"], "show": ["plumeBack", "plumeArmL1", "plumeArmL2", "plumeArmR1", "plumeArmR2"]},
  {"say": "Browning's analogy: the grouped pushes are a teepee of thrust, like the poles of a tent. In his 2021 description of the classic suit, the back engine carries the equipment plus about one third of his body weight; the arms about two thirds.", "unchecked": "Browning: WIRED 2020 (F19); 2021 interview (F9)", "camera": "back", "orbit": -20, "highlight": ["back", "armR1", "armR2"], "focus": ["pilot.skull", "helmet", "pilot.footL", "pilot.footR", "back", "armL1", "armR1"], "annotate": ["aWeight", "lBackShare", "lArmShare"]},
  {"say": "Reported figures, not computed here: about 144 kgf (317 lbf), AOPA 2020; about 155 kgf for an earlier rig, Browning 2017. These are separate total-thrust reports. Record: 136.891 km/h (85.06 mph), Guinness, 2019-11-14.", "unchecked": "Reported and claimed values (F4, F5, F7, F8)", "camera": "hero", "orbit": -40, "annotate": ["lFigs", "l144", "l155", "lBhp", "lRecord"]},
  {"say": "The pilot steers by moving the arms to aim the thrust. Here both arms swing back, so the exhaust is aimed back and a forward component of thrust results. The pose is schematic, not a worked manoeuvre.", "camera": "side", "orbit": 0, "pose": {"pilot": {"with": {"leftElbow": 0, "rightElbow": 0}}, "pilot.upperArmL": {"rot": [0.8192, -0.5299, -0.2195, 53.647]}, "pilot.upperArmR": {"rot": [0.8192, 0.5299, 0.2195, 53.647]}}, "show": ["plumeBack", "plumeArmL1", "plumeArmL2", "plumeArmR1", "plumeArmR2"], "highlight": ["pilot.upperArmL", "pilot.lowerArmL", "pilot.upperArmR", "pilot.lowerArmR", "armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2"], "focus": ["pilot.skull", "helmet", "pilot.footL", "pilot.footR", "armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2", "plumeArmR1", "plumeArmL1"], "annotate": ["lSteer", "aJetBack", "aForward"]},
  {"say": "Inside one engine, cut open: a JetCat-style micro turbojet (schematic example, not confirmed Gravity hardware). The compressor squeezes the air. Fuel burns with oxygen in the compressed air in the combustion chamber.", "camera": "back", "highlight": ["back"], "focus": ["back.casing", "back.impeller", "back.combustor", "back.turbineWheel", "back.nozzle"], "section": {"normal": [-1, 0, 0], "offset": 0, "parts": ["back.casing", "back.intakeLip", "back.diffuser", "back.combustor", "back.nozzleGuideVanes", "back.nozzle"]}, "annotate": ["lJetcat", "lComp", "lComb", "lTurb"], "hide": ["pilot", "helmet", "visor", "chestUnit", "pack", "armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2"]},
  {"say": "JetCat-style example, not confirmed Gravity hardware. Hot gas drives the turbine, which turns the compressor on the same shaft. Gas speeds up out of the nozzle; the reaction is thrust. Shaft: about 120,000 rpm (reported).", "unchecked": "GNAAS figure; not solved by the engine (F13)", "camera": "back", "spin": 1, "highlight": ["back"], "focus": ["back.casing", "back.impeller", "back.combustor", "back.turbineWheel", "back.nozzle"], "section": {"normal": [-1, 0, 0], "offset": 0, "parts": ["back.casing", "back.intakeLip", "back.diffuser", "back.combustor", "back.nozzleGuideVanes", "back.nozzle"]}, "annotate": ["lJetcat", "lRpm", "lNozzle", "aJetOut", "aSpin"], "hide": ["pilot", "helmet", "visor", "chestUnit", "pack", "armL1", "armL2", "armR1", "armR2"]}
